<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">DATE: <span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">D</span>ynamic <span id="id2" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">A</span>bsolute <span id="id3" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">T</span>ime <span id="id4" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">E</span>nhancement for Long Video Understanding</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Chao Yuan
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
