<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 4: </span>A real demo compared DATE-7B with Qwen2.5-VL-7B. The caption is generated with our method and calculate similiarity scores with frames. The <span id="S4.F4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">red</span> points are sampled frames with TASS. More could be foung in <span id="S4.F4.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Appendix</span>.</figcaption>
